        <initializer>NULL</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The random generator state for the PSA subsystem.</para><para>This macro always expands to NULL because the <computeroutput>p_rng</computeroutput> parameter is unused in <ref refid="psa__util_8h_1a6245b5c12af4f716bc8a6475158facd1" kindref="member">mbedtls_psa_get_random()</ref>, but it&apos;s kept for interface&apos;s backward compatibility. </para>        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
